>## Check whether a type is a type (always true for non-encoded types)
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>term isType = λt.cases(model.Type){application=λa.isType (model.ApplicationType[function] a), `forall`=λl.isType (model.ForallType[body] l), `union`=λrt.false, variable=λv.equality.equal v model.Name{"hydra.core.model.Type"}, `_`=false} (strip.deannotateType t)
